WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.791 --> 00:00:32.208
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:32.208 --> 00:00:36.875
spoke of giving buddhi-yoga to His devotees.

3
00:00:36.875 --> 00:00:39.583
Now in this verse,

4
00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:42.625
completing the Chatur-shloki Bhagavad Gita,

5
00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:44.125
He expands on His special

6
00:00:44.125 --> 00:00:47.541
relationship with His devotees.

7
00:00:47.541 --> 00:00:49.125
Lord Krishna explains

8
00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:50.875
that He personally

9
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:53.333
dispels the ignorance of His devotees

10
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:54.958
and illuminates their hearts

11
00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:57.458
with spiritual knowledge.

12
00:00:57.458 --> 00:01:00.375
This verse shows that Lord Krishna

13
00:01:00.375 --> 00:01:03.375
acts not only as a guide,

14
00:01:03.375 --> 00:01:06.833
but also as a protector,

15
00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:11.958
destroying all obstacles born of ignorance.

16
00:01:16.708 --> 00:01:18.083
In this verse,

17
00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:20.500
Lord Krishna describes his role

18
00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:24.500
in the lives of those dedicated to Him.

19
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.000
He tells us

20
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.541
how deeply He cares for His devotees,

21
00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:31.458
how actively He participates

22
00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:33.500
in their journey.

23
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.708
For devotees who remain continuously

24
00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:38.875
dedicated with love and devotion,

25
00:01:38.875 --> 00:01:43.083
residing as Paramatma in their hearts,

26
00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:45.333
He removes the darkness of ignorance

27
00:01:45.333 --> 00:01:48.583
that arises from material bondage.

28
00:01:48.583 --> 00:01:49.708
This ignorance,

29
00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:51.541
like a dense fog,

30
00:01:51.541 --> 00:01:53.541
clouds one's understanding

31
00:01:53.541 --> 00:01:54.791
of their true nature

32
00:01:54.791 --> 00:01:59.458
and their eternal relationship with Lord Krishna.

33
00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:02.791
Lord Krishna promises to destroy this darkness

34
00:02:02.791 --> 00:02:06.208
with the lamp of spiritual knowledge,

35
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:10.125
revealing the path back to Him.

36
00:02:10.125 --> 00:02:12.750
This process is an expression of

37
00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.333
Lord Krishna's anukampa,
His special compassion.

38
00:02:15.333 --> 00:02:17.250
Unlike other knowledge

39
00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:19.875
gained through books, teachers,

40
00:02:19.875 --> 00:02:21.708
or logic,

41
00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:26.750
this knowledge is given
personally by Lord Krishna.

42
00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:29.625
He says His guidance

43
00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:32.250
is not impersonal or distant.

44
00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.916
Residing in the hearts of His devotees,

45
00:02:34.916 --> 00:02:38.041
He provides them clarity and direction.

46
00:02:38.041 --> 00:02:41.750
To understand this better, imagine

47
00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:46.125
trying to find a path in a dense, dark forest.

48
00:02:46.125 --> 00:02:48.541
Without a source of light, every step

49
00:02:48.541 --> 00:02:52.291
feels uncertain and unsettling.

50
00:02:52.291 --> 00:02:55.541
Lord Krishna, like a compassionate guide,

51
00:02:55.541 --> 00:02:58.791
illuminates the path for His devotees,

52
00:02:58.791 --> 00:03:00.500
ensuring

53
00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:03.166
they do not lose their way.

54
00:03:03.166 --> 00:03:04.666
He removes doubts,

55
00:03:04.666 --> 00:03:08.166
wrong beliefs, and attachments,

56
00:03:08.166 --> 00:03:11.125
so the devotee can focus completely

57
00:03:11.125 --> 00:03:14.250
on their spiritual journey.

58
00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:17.125
Lord Krishna's intervention is not without reason.

59
00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:18.708
It is a response to the sincere

60
00:03:18.708 --> 00:03:22.125
love and devotion of His devotees.

61
00:03:22.125 --> 00:03:23.458
Those who come to Him

62
00:03:23.458 --> 00:03:24.958
with a pure heart

63
00:03:24.958 --> 00:03:27.416
and engage in His service

64
00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:30.375
invite His grace,

65
00:03:30.375 --> 00:03:32.416
which removes all obstacles

66
00:03:32.416 --> 00:03:35.208
on the path to self-realisation.

67
00:03:35.208 --> 00:03:38.458
This verse assures us that ultimate success

68
00:03:38.458 --> 00:03:40.666
in spiritual life

69
00:03:40.666 --> 00:03:43.208
depends not only on personal effort

70
00:03:43.208 --> 00:03:44.708
but also on

71
00:03:44.708 --> 00:03:46.875
Lord Krishna's grace.

72
00:03:46.875 --> 00:03:49.375
This inspires the understanding

73
00:03:49.375 --> 00:03:52.375
that Lord Krishna is not only
the final goal of devotion,

74
00:03:52.375 --> 00:03:57.083
but also a constant companion and guide

75
00:03:57.083 --> 00:04:01.958
who ensures the success
of the devotee's journey.

76
00:04:06.375 --> 00:04:11.000
When you face life's challenges,

77
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:15.125
it often feels like,

78
00:04:15.125 --> 00:04:19.125
'God has forgotten me,'

79
00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:23.458
or seeing others succeed, you think,

80
00:04:23.458 --> 00:04:29.041
'God shows more grace to them.' But

81
00:04:29.041 --> 00:04:31.958
I tell you –

82
00:04:31.958 --> 00:04:35.208
My true grace

83
00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:37.333
is not measured

84
00:04:37.333 --> 00:04:40.916
by what you received

85
00:04:40.916 --> 00:04:43.250
or did not receive.

86
00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.041
My grace

87
00:04:45.041 --> 00:04:48.625
lies in the knowledge and understanding

88
00:04:48.625 --> 00:04:51.083
that I give you.

89
00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:55.666
When you begin to understand
the reality of circumstances,

90
00:04:55.666 --> 00:05:00.041
when you recognise the temporary nature

91
00:05:00.041 --> 00:05:02.583
of this world and the true purpose

92
00:05:02.583 --> 00:05:06.583
of your soul,

93
00:05:06.583 --> 00:05:11.666
that itself is the true proof of My grace.

94
00:05:11.666 --> 00:05:13.375
Notice this –

95
00:05:13.375 --> 00:05:17.250
just as washing with soap

96
00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:22.250
slowly removes the dirt from cloth,
in the same way

97
00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:25.375
I remove the stain of ignorance

98
00:05:25.375 --> 00:05:28.666
with the soap of knowledge.

99
00:05:28.666 --> 00:05:31.041
Think about this –

100
00:05:31.041 --> 00:05:33.083
when someone

101
00:05:33.083 --> 00:05:36.166
is sunk in deep grief

102
00:05:36.166 --> 00:05:41.333
and feels there is no solution,

103
00:05:41.333 --> 00:05:43.125
suddenly a thought

104
00:05:43.125 --> 00:05:46.708
comes to their mind

105
00:05:46.708 --> 00:05:49.541
that helps them see the whole situation

106
00:05:49.541 --> 00:05:53.458
from a new perspective.

107
00:05:53.458 --> 00:05:56.333
That intuition

108
00:05:56.333 --> 00:05:59.958
is My signal.

109
00:05:59.958 --> 00:06:01.750
Do not judge My love

110
00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:05.125
by outer circumstances.

111
00:06:05.125 --> 00:06:07.375
Recognise the clarity,

112
00:06:07.375 --> 00:06:11.416
strength,

113
00:06:11.416 --> 00:06:14.416
and wisdom growing within your mind.

114
00:06:14.416 --> 00:06:19.791
This is My true gift to you –

115
00:06:19.791 --> 00:06:23.125
guidance on the path

116
00:06:23.125 --> 00:06:27.208
of meaningful and spiritual growth.

117
00:06:31.708 --> 00:06:35.750
On life's path, how often

118
00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:39.750
do we, seeing the prosperity

119
00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:43.458
of other families, question our own fate?

120
00:06:43.458 --> 00:06:46.708
In family life, it is natural

121
00:06:46.708 --> 00:06:50.250
to wonder why some families

122
00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:53.708
face fewer struggles,

123
00:06:53.708 --> 00:06:59.875
while others remain surrounded by challenges.

124
00:06:59.875 --> 00:07:02.708
You ask yourself,

125
00:07:02.708 --> 00:07:04.625
'Is Lord Krishna

126
00:07:04.625 --> 00:07:07.416
more merciful to them

127
00:07:07.416 --> 00:07:10.541
and neglecting us?'

128
00:07:10.541 --> 00:07:12.500
Know this –

129
00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.750
My special grace

130
00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:18.583
is not about material comforts.

131
00:07:18.583 --> 00:07:23.333
Nor is it about the absence of difficulties.

132
00:07:23.333 --> 00:07:26.458
It is about the understanding

133
00:07:26.458 --> 00:07:29.666
I give you,

134
00:07:29.666 --> 00:07:33.250
by which you can make sense of life

135
00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:37.500
and move forward wisely.

136
00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:39.333
See –

137
00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:41.541
in a family, disputes

138
00:07:41.541 --> 00:07:44.625
between children cannot be resolved

139
00:07:44.625 --> 00:07:48.625
by scolding or punishment. But

140
00:07:48.625 --> 00:07:52.250
when parents, with love, patience,
and understanding,

141
00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:55.375
listen to their children's feelings,

142
00:07:55.375 --> 00:07:57.916
those very disputes

143
00:07:57.916 --> 00:08:00.583
resolve in a moment.

144
00:08:00.583 --> 00:08:04.458
Sweetness returns to the family.

145
00:08:04.458 --> 00:08:06.291
This understanding

146
00:08:06.291 --> 00:08:08.666
is itself My blessing.

147
00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:12.916
When your family accepts life's ups and downs

148
00:08:12.916 --> 00:08:16.041
as part of a larger

149
00:08:16.041 --> 00:08:20.083
purpose,

150
00:08:20.083 --> 00:08:21.458
that itself

151
00:08:21.458 --> 00:08:24.916
is proof of My grace.

152
00:08:24.916 --> 00:08:27.750
When you learn to live, even in difficult times,

153
00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.958
with harmony, patience,

154
00:08:29.958 --> 00:08:33.583
and devotion,

155
00:08:33.583 --> 00:08:38.625
that is My guidance at work

156
00:08:38.625 --> 00:08:41.625
within your inner self.

157
00:08:41.625 --> 00:08:45.833
Through this clarity, you understand
the importance

158
00:08:45.833 --> 00:08:50.333
of love, devotion, and spiritual growth.

159
00:08:50.333 --> 00:08:52.375
Understanding their importance,

160
00:08:52.375 --> 00:08:56.666
in life you begin to prioritise them.

161
00:08:56.666 --> 00:09:00.000
Tell your family this –

162
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.083
life's problems

163
00:09:02.083 --> 00:09:05.041
are not proof

164
00:09:05.041 --> 00:09:08.458
that I have forgotten you.

165
00:09:08.458 --> 00:09:11.125
Rather, they are opportunities

166
00:09:11.125 --> 00:09:14.375
to deepen understanding.

167
00:09:14.375 --> 00:09:16.166
With this perspective,

168
00:09:16.166 --> 00:09:18.833
your family will be more

169
00:09:18.833 --> 00:09:23.250
united and stronger in faith and knowledge,

170
00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:27.125
and you will all move forward together

171
00:09:27.125 --> 00:09:28.958
in the light of wisdom.

172
00:09:33.291 --> 00:09:36.875
Giving money to someone in need

173
00:09:36.875 --> 00:09:41.416
helps them only for a short while.

174
00:09:41.416 --> 00:09:42.833
But

175
00:09:42.833 --> 00:09:44.666
teaching that

176
00:09:44.666 --> 00:09:47.958
person a skill

177
00:09:47.958 --> 00:09:53.041
gives them a means of livelihood.

178
00:09:53.041 --> 00:09:55.000
Teaching the skill

179
00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:59.125
is the true help.

180
00:09:59.125 --> 00:10:00.625
At the workplace,

181
00:10:00.625 --> 00:10:01.958
many people

182
00:10:01.958 --> 00:10:06.250
believe that helping a colleague means

183
00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:09.083
solving their problems

184
00:10:09.083 --> 00:10:12.416
or taking their workload upon yourself.

185
00:10:12.416 --> 00:10:16.416
Although these acts of help are valuable,

186
00:10:16.416 --> 00:10:17.333
but

187
00:10:17.333 --> 00:10:23.416
the best help you can offer is

188
00:10:23.416 --> 00:10:25.125
knowledge

189
00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:30.541
which develops them and
makes them self-reliant.

190
00:10:30.541 --> 00:10:34.125
Like Me, you too spread the light of knowledge

191
00:10:34.125 --> 00:10:39.041
and make people self-reliant.

192
00:10:39.041 --> 00:10:41.875
This is the truest form of help.

193
00:10:41.875 --> 00:10:46.958
Think of a colleague struggling with a task.

194
00:10:46.958 --> 00:10:48.125
Instead of

195
00:10:48.125 --> 00:10:52.125
completing the work for them,

196
00:10:52.125 --> 00:10:55.458
explain the process to them.

197
00:10:55.458 --> 00:10:58.041
Show them the tools,

198
00:10:58.041 --> 00:11:02.750
and teach them how to do the work in detail.

199
00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:07.541
When you remove the darkness of confusion,

200
00:11:07.541 --> 00:11:12.750
you are not just solving one problem.

201
00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:13.916
You are making them

202
00:11:13.916 --> 00:11:16.500
capable of facing many future challenges

203
00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:19.583
on their own.

204
00:11:19.583 --> 00:11:22.500
The purpose of true leadership

205
00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:25.958
is to make people self-reliant,

206
00:11:25.958 --> 00:11:30.291
to build confidence within them.
